    --
    + generateDailyTasks() : void
  }
  note right of DailyTaskGenerationScheduler
    Runs daily at 5 AM.
    For each user, checks all active domains.
    If a domain has 0 pending tasks,
    calls AI to generate 2-4 new tasks
    based on recent progress, PRs,
    streaks, weekly stats, and feel patterns.
    Tasks are progressive — not repetitive.
  end note
  class InsightsRefreshScheduler {
    - domainRepository : DomainRepository
    - insightsService : InsightsService
    - jobLogService : JobLogService
    --
    + refreshInsights() : void
  }
  note right of InsightsRefreshScheduler
    Runs 3 AM daily. Regenerates cached
    domain_insights for every ACTIVE domain
    (per-domain) so the Progress tab never
    calls Gemini on load. Wrapped in JobLogService.
  end note
  class TokenCleanupScheduler {
    --
    + cleanExpired() : void
  }
  class AiLimitResetScheduler {
    - userRepository : UserRepository
    - jobLogService : JobLogService
    --
    + resetDailyAiUsage() : void
  }
  note right of AiLimitResetScheduler
    Runs midnight. Resets every user's
    ai_used_today to 0 so per-user AI
    daily limits refresh each day.
  end note
  class MilestoneTopUpScheduler {
    - domainRepository : DomainRepository
    - milestoneService : MilestoneService
    - jobLogService : JobLogService
    --
    + topUpMilestones() : void
  }
  note right of MilestoneTopUpScheduler
    Runs 2 AM. For each ACTIVE domain with
    no active milestones but >=1 DONE, calls
    MilestoneService.generateNextMilestone to
    AI-generate ONE progressive milestone.
    Guard skips domains cleared deliberately
    (no DONE history).
  end note
  class PasswordResetTokenCleanupScheduler {
    - passwordResetTokenRepository : PasswordResetTokenRepository
    - jobLogService : JobLogService
    --
    + cleanupTokens() : void
  }
  note right of PasswordResetTokenCleanupScheduler
    Runs hourly (cron 0 0 * * * ?). Deletes used
    or expired password_reset_tokens so the table
    stays bounded. Wrapped in JobLogService.
  end note
  note bottom of scheduler
    All schedulers wrapped with
    JobLogService.run(name, task) which
    records each execution (SUCCESS/FAILED
    + error + details) to job_execution_logs
    for auditing.
    Active: DailyNudge (midnight),
    StreakCheck (midnight), AiLimitReset
    (midnight), DailyTaskGeneration (5 AM).
  end note
}

